# What the editor writes while the example is open: its caches and layout.
/.pulsar/*
# But the project's settings that differ from the defaults are the
# example's: GI's probes a metre apart over open ground, and the terrain's
# sky rays walking two of their spacings.
!/.pulsar/project/
/.pulsar/project/*
!/.pulsar/project/gi.toml
!/.pulsar/project/voxels.toml
